meta {
  name: Prism
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Recording API (what the Flash shortcuts call). Every request except Health needs
  `Authorization: Bearer <LUMITRACE_API_TOKEN>`. Uploads answer `202` with a `capture_id`;
  the notes and recording requests save it so **Capture status** works right after.

  For the multipart requests, put files in `bruno/samples/` (git-ignored) or pick one in the
  Body tab.
}
